  "audit_notes": [
    "Independently solve the two non-source grounded node equations at each original row. Recompute KCL and terminal power from independently measured native branch currents and voltages.",
    "Interpret signed RMS branch current using voltage at the source in each phase as the phase reference. Compare each six-window metric to the frozen ranges.",
    "After the sending end opens, positive R-to-F current means the source still reaches the fault via the healthy path and receiving bus. After the second opening both path currents are leakage while receiving power continues.",
    "The original vendor case motivates the two-ended isolation. This independently assembled circuit uses simultaneous three-phase commanded finite resistances and includes restoration. Its qualification uses its own native waveforms."
  ]
